<h3><u>ya elahi mujhe abbas sa beta</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><p  -1in; text-align: center;""><strong>(Sakhi Abb</strong></p>

<p  -1in; text-align: center;""><strong>(Sakhi Abbas Jari Ya ilaahi mujhe de) x2</strong></p>

<p  -1in; text-align: center;"">&nbsp;</p>

<p  -1in; text-align: center;""><strong>Ek jari chaahiye taarike shujaa&#39;at ke liye, Karbala mein mere Shabbir ki nusrat ke liye</strong></p>

<p  -1in; text-align: center;""><strong>Aur na munh se payambar ki hifaazat ke liye, Ya ELAAHI mujhe Abbas-sa beta dede</strong></p>

<p  -1in; text-align: center;""><strong>(Jab mere ghar mein Alam hay to Alamdaar bhi ho) x3</strong></p>

<p  -1in; text-align: center;"">&nbsp;</p>

<p  -1in; text-align: center;""><strong>Shukr sad shukr tera shabbar-o-shabbir diye, Betiyaan ki hai ata zainab-o-kulsoom mujhe</strong></p>

<p  -1in; text-align: center;""><strong>Baad iske meri bas ek dua ke badle, Ya ELAAHI mujhe Abbas-sa beta dede</strong></p>

<p  -1in; text-align: center;""><strong>(Jab mere ghar mein Alam hay to Alamdaar bhi ho) x3</strong></p>

<p  -1in; text-align: center;"">&nbsp;</p>

<p  -1in; text-align: center;""><strong>Aaina sabr-o-shujaat ka bana na mera, Hu bahu meri hi tasweer ho baccha mera</strong></p>

<p  -1in; text-align: center;""><strong>Usko dekhoon to nazar aaye sarapa mera, Ya ELAAHI mujhe abbas sa beta dede</strong></p>

<p  -1in; text-align: center;""><strong>(Jab mere ghar mein Alam hay to Alamdaar bhi ho) x3</strong></p>

<p  -1in; text-align: center;"">&nbsp;</p>

<p  -1in; text-align: center;""><strong>Koi be-yar-o-madadgaar agar hojaye, Iltaja behre madad apni zabaan par laye</strong></p>

<p  -1in; text-align: center;""><strong>Mujko awaaz koi de wo madad ko aaye, Ya ELAAHI mujhe abbas sa beta dede</strong></p>

<p  -1in; text-align: center;""><strong>(Jab mere ghar mein Alam hay to Alamdaar bhi ho) x3</strong></p>

<p  -1in; text-align: center;"">&nbsp;</p>

<p  -1in; text-align: center;""><strong>Zindagi jiski guzar jaye alamdaari me, Apne baazoo bhi kata de jo fidakaari me</strong></p>

<p  -1in; text-align: center;""><strong>Sabse aage nazar aaye jo wafadaari me, Ya ELAAHI mujhe abbas sa beta dede</strong></p>

<p  -1in; text-align: center;""><strong>(Jab mere ghar mein Alam hay to Alamdaar bhi ho) x3</strong></p>

<p  -1in; text-align: center;"">&nbsp;</p>

<p  -1in; text-align: center;""><strong>Naam uska ho jin hoton pe wahan pyas na ho, Koi umeed na toote koi be aas na ho</strong></p>

<p  -1in; text-align: center;""><strong>Yaad karke use tanhai ka ehsaas na ho, Ya ELAAHI mujhe abbas sa beta dede</strong></p>

<p  -1in; text-align: center;""><strong>(Jab mere ghar mein Alam hay to Alamdaar bhi ho) x3</strong></p>

<p  -1in; text-align: center;"">&nbsp;</p>

<p  -1in; text-align: center;""><strong>Mere maalik mere honthhon pe jab aayi ye dua, Meri aankhon mein nazar aane lagi Karbobala</strong></p>

<p  -1in; text-align: center;""><strong>Mera Shabbir musibat mein kharaa hay tanhaa, Ya ELAAHI mujhe Abbas-sa beta dede</strong></p>

<p  -1in; text-align: center;""><strong>(Jab mere ghar mein Alam hay to Alamdaar bhi ho) x3</strong></p>

<p  -1in; text-align: center;"">&nbsp;</p>

<p  -1in; text-align: center;""><strong>Jab woh karbal mein ho chawbhees pehel ka pyaasa, Har kadam par use isaar ka jazba dena</strong></p>

<p  -1in; text-align: center;""><strong>Aur mere laal ke haathonko salaamat rakhna, Ya ELAAHI mujhe Abbas-sa beta dede</strong></p>

<p  -1in; text-align: center;""><strong>(Jab mere ghar mein Alam hay to Alamdaar bhi ho) x3</strong></p>

<p  -1in; text-align: center;"">&nbsp;</p>

<p  -1in; text-align: center;""><strong>Ay &quot;kaleem&quot; ho gayi maqbool duaa-e-Haidar, Usko &quot;Mesum&quot; kaha hai Fatema Zehra ne pisar</strong></p>

<p  -1in; text-align: center;""><strong>Arzu ki thi Ali ne jo huzur-e-daawar, Ya ELAAHI mujhe Abbas-sa beta dede</strong></p>

<p  -1in; text-align: center;""><strong>(Jab mere ghar mein Alam hay to Alamdaar bhi ho) x3</strong></p>
</p>